  <item>
    <title>中医学生做心内介入是什么体验——中医学生分化之路1|Vol22</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a1ab500ac7bdb080c332df6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a1ab500ac7bdb080c332df6</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 30 May 2026 10:09:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>简介</span></h2><p><span>今天的嘉宾雷哥是我的本科同学，我一直看着她在院内专心致志做临床，而且朋友圈聊天动辄就是专业术语，非常印象深刻。当我得知她以中医内科出身最终从事于心内介入的时候，我很震惊，因为就算在外科里，介入都是比较困难的领域。当我进一步得知她为什么要走上这个方向，突然理解了——她的好朋友因心脏原因英年早逝，此后她立志成为一位优秀的心内大夫</span></p><p><span>正如张锡纯《屡试屡效方 自序》中所说“人生有大愿力，而后有大建树”</span></p><p><span>通过这期节目，你将听到，足够坚定的愿力会诞生多么强大的力量</span></p><p></p><h2><span>时间轴</span></h2><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="195">03:15</a> 嘉宾自我介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 嘉宾学习中医的起点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="496">08:16</a> 志愿活动、社团经历与成长</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 为什么没有从中医转西医</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a> 真正的学习发生在实践中</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="973">16:13</a> 向上社交</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 如何找到适合自己的导师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 好大夫、好老师、好研究员的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 如何根据目标选择导师</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a> 科研思维的重要性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1910">31:50</a> 选择导师的方法论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2178">36:18</a> 我的研究生三年：从不会到上手术</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2530">42:10</a> 为什么我能竞争过本院研究生</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2853">47:33</a> 规培与规培生的区别</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> 规培最大的收获：主动学习</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3355">55:55</a> 西医介入治疗前后，中医能做什么？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3552">59:12</a> 给医学生和年轻医生的建议</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>关联节目</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>Vol.20中医小白如何成为针灸大夫➡️</span><a class="normal_text_link" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694f226e2db086f8972b0844" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694f226e2db086f8972b0844"><span>点击这里在小宇宙收听</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>Vol.10和北中医硕士毕业生聊聊社区医院和规培➡️</span><a class="normal_text_link" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b620836a43241529b49150" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b620836a43241529b49150"><span>点击这里在小宇宙收听</span></a><span>，</span><a class="normal_text_link" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1964y1w7cv/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1964y1w7cv/"><span>点击这里在bilibili收听</span></a></p></li><li><p><span>Vol.8和北中医博士聊中医生如何度过规培➡️</span><a class="normal_text_link" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652deee80432a31578782247" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/652deee80432a31578782247"><span>点击这里收听小宇宙</span></a><span>，</span><a class="normal_text_link" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JN4y1C7X9/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JN4y1C7X9/"><span>点击这里在bilibili收听</span></a></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>---</span></p><p><span>本期主播：王白水</span></p><p><span>制作人：王白水</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
