  <item>
    <title>vol15医学生+陪诊=？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f2f7b02adfe48b83305eee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f2f7b02adfe48b83305eee</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Sep 2024 17:32:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span># 简述</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期邀请到的嘉宾是不疾陪诊的创始人刘建国</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊了聊陪诊这个新兴行业，它的历史、现状、未来，作为一个新鲜事物，存在着诸多可能与困境。并且现阶段尚未成熟的状态下，缺乏大量高素质人才的加入，从这个角度来说，溢出的医学生资源似乎可以对接过来</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你从未了解过陪诊是什么，欢迎来听🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你了解过但不知从和入手，欢迎来听🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你正是医学生想找个兼职，欢迎来听🤗</span></p><span></span><p><span># 收听地址</span></p><span></span><p><span>[小宇宙](<a data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f2f7b02adfe48b83305eee" href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f2f7b02adfe48b83305eee">www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com</a>)</span></p><span></span><p><span>[bilibili](<a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1acseeqEXn" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1acseeqEXn">www.bilibili.com</a>)</span></p><span></span><p><span># 主要内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 什么是陪诊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 白水怎么看陪诊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 白水的一次代问诊经验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 嘉宾评价本次案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a> 算算账，购买陪诊服务其实是帮患者省钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1012">16:52</a> 陪诊现在的困境：各大社交平台的限制；市场认知度不足；新兴行业尚未规范</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 从陪诊聊到互联网医院，顺便安利《万物生长》播客的互联网医院简史系列节目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 陪诊如何补充医患关系欠缺的部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1759">29:19</a> 陪诊行业的就业现状，现阶段缺乏高素质从业者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> 如何成为一个合格的陪诊师</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 灵光一现：医学生去做陪诊岂不美哉？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 怎么看待学生兼职陪诊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2789">46:29</a> 陪诊兼职和普通兼职的收入对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3189">53:09</a> 多走走多看看多聊聊，路就会越来越宽</span></p><span></span><p><span># 了解更多</span></p><span></span><p><span>进群请在公众号“小白尽话论”后台回复“陪诊”</span></p><span></span><p><span>有意向参与管理工作请发送简历至`whitewatercn@beginner.center`</span></p><span></span><p><span># 关于小白尽话论</span></p><span></span><p><span>小白尽话论是始徒团队的播客项目，面向中医学生的播客节目，通过对谈，换个角度。话题包括但不限于中医、学习、科研、日常、校园等</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你有感兴趣的内容，欢迎在评论留言，也许在下一期话题就来自这里😁</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你想参加进来，欢迎关注公众号留言（始徒）</span></p><span></span><p><span>或者在我们的网站上留言<a data-url="https://forum.beginner.center" href="https://forum.beginner.center">forum.beginner.center</a></span></p><span></span><p><span># 招募</span></p><span></span><p><span>来自小白尽话论的邀请——我们正在寻找：主播、后期、策划、设计等伙伴。[详细信息与申请方式，请点击链接](<a data-url="https://beginner.feishu.cn/docx/OOXzd3Cxjoqjlmx0wVgcyMagngF?from=from_copylink" href="https://beginner.feishu.cn/docx/OOXzd3Cxjoqjlmx0wVgcyMagngF?from=from_copylink">beginner.feishu.cn</a>)</span></p>]]></description>
